Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:04.00,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You're quite tough, but it's time to end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.02,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Gnome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:07.23,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.10,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Liese!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:08.95,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.88,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I'll tear through you and your spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:17.87,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:20.39,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,One more where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:28.91,Main - Italics,YULIGA/ID,0,0,0,,The gnome wasn't a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:30.94,Main - Italics,YULIGA/ID,0,0,0,,It was there to block my view!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:34.27,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:00:59.14,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:08.65,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:31.32,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Urza! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.19,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Salamander!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:47.93,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Salamander's full might\Nwas behind those flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:50.65,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Not even a demon could survive unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:01:58.57,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:00.35,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Our training paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.35,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You also did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:04.87,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:11.47,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,They won pretty handily after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:14.61,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:16.65,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:24.49,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:31.18,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:07.06,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:09.43,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You dodged my attack earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.81,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:15.53,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I should be the faster of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:16.82,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:18.94,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:21.94,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Well, you're a one-trick pony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:24.07,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,One-trick...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:27.10,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,In fact, your moves are stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:29.14,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,They're too straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:33.43,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You were fighting better when \Nyou were holding back against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.83,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:39.71,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Could it be that this is the first time\Nyou've put your life on the line in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:41.03,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,That's it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:45.31,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,In other words, you lack experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:49.72,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,When we do something unexpected, \Nit shakes you and you respond poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:54.45,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I bet people tell you\N that you're too earnest or square.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:57.26,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Your personality is expressed \Nin the way you fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:59.23,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,People like you are easy to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:03.62,Main - Italics,LIESE/ID,0,0,0,,I mean, granted...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:07.49,Main - Italics,URZA/ID,0,0,0,,We only get to say that \Nbecause our strategy worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.75,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I see. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:17.10,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Then shall we continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:19.50,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah. The real battle starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:23.76,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:26.01,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:27.26,Default,URZA & LIESE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:28.73,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,She's surrendering?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:31.19,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:34.44,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I merely underestimated you the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:37.02,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly lose at my full strength—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:38.65,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Or so I believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:42.37,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,However, it would appear I was mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:45.31,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:48.57,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I fear neither defeat nor death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:52.70,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,To surrender to humanoids makes my blood boil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:58.71,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,But our liege has ordered me to return alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:03.33,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,So as there is a possibility I may lose,\NI cannot engage you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.71,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I shall give up on the holy sword for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:11.63,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I-In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:13.30,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:14.31,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:18.56,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Now that I've surrendered, \Nwhat would you have me do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.41,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:22.58,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What {\i1}do{\i0} we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:24.90,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,D-Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:28.32,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Since she surrendered, \Ncan't we tell her to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:32.12,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! We can't let a demon go free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:34.98,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What? I mean, I get that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:40.09,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I'm sure {\i1}you'd{\i0} be all too happy\N to cut down a foe begging for their life...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.33,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I take no delight in that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:44.24,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,But I can't blacken my heart like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:45.71,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,My heart isn't black either!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:50.72,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I know. Didn't Kyle want information?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:52.74,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Information, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:56.97,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,He wanted to know about demons \Ninfiltrating humanoid lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:03.98,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,We were the only two on such \Norders from our sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:05.71,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:11.09,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Others may have trespassed of their \Nown volition, but I wouldn't know of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.62,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,No, I suppose you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.54,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:18.82,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We'd have to ask Kyle about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:19.87,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:24.45,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,If you were men, I would've \Nbeen willing to sleep with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.26,0:07:26.79,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,S-Sleep with...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:28.48,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I'd even accept a substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.72,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Perhaps that man Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:32.89,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,A-Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.59,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,There's no need for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:38.02,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We've heard enough! Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:40.27,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:42.66,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,In that case, I take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:48.40,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,They fell for that hook, line, and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:55.66,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,By the way, I haven't gotten your names yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.41,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I'm Liese.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:02.67,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'm Urza.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:05.37,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:08.33,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,My name is Yuliga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.33,0:08:10.14,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Remember it, if it pleases you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:19.62,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I guess demons are pretty polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.55,0:08:23.83,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Not only did she surrender,\Nshe gave her name to humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:26.81,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,That would've been unthinkable in my era.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:34.67,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:37.10,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'll just be testing my blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:47.35,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Before we fight, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.85,0:08:50.67,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Where is my horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:52.21,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I've got it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.72,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You can take it off my body if you defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:58.82,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:01.71,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Now then, let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.99,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,He's skilled with ranged attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:08.73,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I need to find a way to get in close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.01,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:13.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Haste!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.05,0:09:15.42,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I'll finish this quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:19.62,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,He's not dodging?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:26.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:29.49,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You can't avoid me when you're this close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.83,0:09:39.78,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You escaped a direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:42.64,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,But that still cost you two or three ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:52.15,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This is my punishment for allowing \Na mere human to best me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:55.63,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,He's different from three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:58.66,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,This must be his true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:01.78,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Your expression has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:05.10,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,In our great war with the humanoids\N three centuries ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:08.67,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I killed countless people\N who looked at me just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.05,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,How long can you keep running?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:24.42,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I need to find a way to close in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:27.31,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,A suicide attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:29.23,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:38.11,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,It's futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:49.42,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your unsightly,\N pointless struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:52.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Want me to break your horn?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:56.59,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.93,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:02.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If I shatter this, you'll never restore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:05.65,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,While I do value my horn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.85,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,don't go thinking I'll trade my life for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.98,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:31.21,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:34.26,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No, I'll show you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:01.15,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Is this the ace up your sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:04.95,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I must applaud your tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:07.16,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I'll be finishing things here and now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:13.16,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You were impressively formidable,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:17.99,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,but the difference in strength between \Nhumanoids and demons is insurmountable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:21.46,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You may reflect on that as you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:23.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:30.68,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know all too well how terrifying \Nand powerful demons are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:35.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's why I'll do anything \Nin order to defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:43.54,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:45.67,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What could this possibly accomplish now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.83,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:53.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,A powerful adhesive made by a genius artificer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:55.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Once applied, it can never be unstuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll show you something else special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:13.26,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's a chain forged by a dwarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:15.46,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:17.90,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:20.87,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:24.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That was specially made to stand up to magma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:25.99,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:28.24,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's mithril.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:30.84,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,This is mithril chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:34.22,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I had it made just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.25,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:43.94,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,As promised, you're going to tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.52,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:14:03.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,First, is it true that the current demon king\N doesn't desire conflict with humanoids?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:06.02,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.01,0:14:10.53,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Ruiza is the previous king's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:13.70,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,She's had dealings with humanoids in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:17.79,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,That is apparently the reason \Nshe desires the holy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:21.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But humanoids and demons are mortal enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:25.30,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm amazed the other demons \Nhaven't voiced their discontent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.02,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Of course they have!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:32.46,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,We were sent here to scout at the \Ninsistence of the pro-war faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:35.93,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,King Ruiza herself was not keen on the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:40.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So there are multiple factions\N among the demons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:45.82,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Does this mean the pro-war faction is \Nacting to supplant the current king?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:49.39,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,King Ruiza's power is immeasurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:53.15,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Taking the throne would be no simple task.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:57.83,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My next question is my most burning one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:00.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Think carefully when you answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:08.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is there a black-winged, hornless \Ncandidate in line for the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:10.58,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Hornless?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:12.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You must know something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:18.71,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,There couldn't possibly be anyone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:19.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.91,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,A demon's horns are our pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:24.86,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,A hornless could never be crowned!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:30.61,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,And I've never heard of a black-winged demon \Npowerful enough to become king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:34.91,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:38.72,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Then you haven't met the next demon king yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.37,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:46.51,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I guess all this was for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:48.75,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:52.01,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,King Ruiza may know something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:56.54,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I can arrange an audience\N with King Ruiza herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:16:00.89,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Normally, it would be unthinkable\Nfor a humanoid to meet the demon king!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:03.06,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,That should entice you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:06.65,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:08.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You'd better not try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:10.90,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:12.90,Main - Italics,GARNIAS/ID,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:15.50,Main - Italics,GARNIAS/ID,0,0,0,,He let victory slip from his grasp so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:21.66,Main - Italics,GARNIAS/ID,0,0,0,,Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:29.48,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:31.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You were staring too intently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:34.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I didn't even have to look \Nto know where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:37.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's a real shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:43.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If you'd taken me to your king like you said,\N you could've lived a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,These must have been responsible \Nfor the embassy massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:54.32,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They are invisible magical beings you conjure,\N and you can control multiple at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Invisible Assassins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:02.08,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,H-How do you know about my secret weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:06.08,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I knew it the instant I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:08.97,Flashback,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,That was also our collaborator's request.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:10.93,Flashback,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,How could I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:12.26,Flashback - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,That demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:19.83,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You don't know this, \Nbut we've met before, Garnias.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:23.77,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,H-How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:26.09,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,We've met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:30.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I've finally figured out why \Nsomething's seemed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:37.86,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,During the Great Invasion, \NI felt a mysterious fear of your kind—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:42.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,your fierce loyalty to your \Nruler, the demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But I sense none of that in you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:52.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're still strong, but you don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.44,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.80,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Just who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:18:00.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:01.21,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.85,0:18:08.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Garnias.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:19.45,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You once killed many of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:22.23,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But I'm also grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:26.22,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're the one who gave me the \Nlocation of the demon king's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:34.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But you refused to tell me anything\Nabout the actual demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.43,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:41.72,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:47.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Without that intel from you, our final \Nsuicide attack never would've worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:52.23,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,As my way of thanking you, \NI'll let you in on a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:58.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Even when exposed to magma, it takes \Nan entire day for mithril to melt through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:02.62,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I've had those chains \Nsubmerged for half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:08.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If you can hold out for another \Nhalf-day, you might survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:15.50,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this... I swear you'll pay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:29.02,Main - Italics,KYLE,0,0,0,,His death throes weren't much\Ndifferent from last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:15.90,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.14,0:21:21.86,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is, \Nbut it was trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:26.70,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,It was probably a trap set for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.13,0:21:30.60,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,It must've been commanded \Nto attack if I came through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:33.10,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Theron, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:36.66,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Did you attack her while her guard was down?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:40.73,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Nah, don't get me wrong. I saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:41.81,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:43.06,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You saved her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:48.61,Default,SILODNIA,0,0,0,,I see. What a nasty magical life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:52.99,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Did that male demon send this after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:59.14,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Yes. The worst insult a demon can suffer \Nis having a horn broken by a humanoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.49,0:22:04.51,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,He probably intended to silence me before \NI could report to the demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:06.97,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Sounds like something he'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.86,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,He even looked like he had \Na terrible personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:12.26,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,But in Theron's case, despite appearances...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:15.84,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Are you admitting even I \Nhave my good qualities?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:18.83,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Please! You'll make me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.15,0:22:22.10,Main - Italics,THERON/ID,0,0,0,,I can't tell them I {\i0}was{\i1} trying to kill her
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:26.99,Main - Italics,THERON/ID,0,0,0,,and only switched targets on instinct\Nbecause I sensed a strange presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:30.53,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:35.54,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll take you up\N on your offer to sleep with—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.43,0:22:40.77,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.11,0:22:48.03,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I doubt we'll meet again, \Nbut I shall remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:23:00.06,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Anyway, she sure was strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:03.53,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'd like to face her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:09.18,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Except if we ever do, our next \Nfight's sure to be a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:14.70,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You're right. Yuliga will grow \Nfrom her first real battle and loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:18.86,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,She'll be an even more powerful enemy \Nwhen she stands in our way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:25.83,Main - Italics,THERON/ID,0,0,0,,Kyle told me not to let her leave alive, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.71,0:23:31.25,Main - Top,LIESE,0,0,0,,Why don't we work on a killer combo move next?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.11,0:23:30.53,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\blur1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,208.461)}The Heroic Tale Continues
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.63,0:23:39.93,Default,NA,0,0,0,,Next time: "The Heroic Tale Continues."
